# Webflow to Next.js Conversion

## Webflow Export Structure (This Project)
```
webflow-source/
├── index.html, services.html, contact.html, etc.   # Original HTML (reference)
├── styles/
│   ├── normalize.css               # Keep as-is
│   ├── webflow.css                 # Base styles (~39KB) — run PurgeCSS
│   └── nside-cloneable-cms-template-db517e.webflow.css  # Custom (~141KB)
├── public/js/
│   └── webflow.js                  # ~770KB jQuery runtime — load lazy
├── public/images/                  # Convert to WebP, use next/image
├── public/fonts/                   # EudoxusSans (6 weights)
└── public/documents/               # JSON animation/interaction files (dropdown-easey, menu-nav, etc.)
```

## Integration Pattern (cheerio + html-react-parser)
```tsx
import cheerio from 'cheerio'
import parse, { domToReact } from 'html-react-parser'

// Replace <img> with next/image, <a> with next/link
const replace = (domNode) => {
  if (domNode.name === 'img') {
    return <Image src={domNode.attribs.src} alt={domNode.attribs.alt || ''} width={800} height={600} />
  }
}
```

## Cleanup Checklist
- [ ] Remove `data-wf-site`, `data-wf-page`, `data-wf-domain` attributes
- [ ] Remove `<meta name="generator" content="Webflow">`
- [ ] Remove scripts pointing to `*.webflow.com`
- [ ] Remove Webflow badge HTML
- [ ] Run PurgeCSS on webflow.css: `npx purgecss --css ./styles/webflow.css --content ./webflow-source/*.html`
- [ ] Load webflow.js with `next/script strategy="lazyOnload"`
- [ ] Update CSS url() paths: `../fonts/` → `/fonts/`, `../images/` → `/images/`

## CSS Import Order in layout.tsx
```tsx
import '../styles/normalize.css'
import '../styles/webflow.css'
import '../styles/nside-cloneable-cms-template-db517e.webflow.css'
```

## webflow.js Modules Safe to Remove
- `Webflow.define('maps')` — if no Google Maps
- `Webflow.define('slider')` — if no sliders
- `Webflow.define('tabs')` — if no tabs
- `Webflow.define('lightbox')` — if no lightbox
- KEEP `Webflow.define('touch')` — other widgets depend on it

## Re-initialize Webflow Interactions in React
```tsx
useEffect(() => {
  window.Webflow && window.Webflow.destroy()
  window.Webflow && window.Webflow.ready()
  window.Webflow && window.Webflow.require('ix2').init()
  document.dispatchEvent(new Event('readystatechange'))
}, [])
```
